<title>USA: Witco sees Q4 operating net flat yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Witco sees Q4 operating net flat yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Witco Corp said Thursday its fourth quarter 1996 net income from continuing operations is expected to be about equal to that of the same quarter in 1995 excluding non-recurring items from both periods.</p>
<p>The company earlier announced a restructuring plan calling for a reduction in annual operating costs of more than $200 million by the end of 1999.</p>
